	(text "Place here:\n  • J1: RJ45 with integrated PoE-rated magnetics\n        (Bel Fuse 0826-1G1T-DV-F or Pulse JK0-0177NL)\n  • U101, U102: NUP4202W1T1G ESD arrays on MDI pairs\n  • Bob Smith termination on cable side (verify in jack datasheet)\n  • R for Chassis-GND-to-circuit-GND bleed (1 MΩ + 1 nF/2 kV)\n\nMDI labels below = secondary (PHY-side) of magnetics.\nPair-set labels = center taps for PoE power extraction.\n\nSee BUILD-SHEET-01.md for step-by-step component placement."
